config BR2_PACKAGE_GARGOYLE_QUOTAS
	bool "gargoyle-quotas"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_GARGOYLE_BANDWIDTH
	help
	  Userspace support for bandwidth quotas.

	  Builds libiptbwctl, the library that talks to the xt_bandwidth
	  match over its get/setsockopt interface, and quota_backup, which
	  persists quota usage counters across reboots (they otherwise live
	  only in kernel memory).

	  The quota rules themselves are generated by rc; this package only
	  provides the counter plumbing.

	  Originally from Gargoyle router firmware (gargoyle-router.com).
